[{:adr/authoritative_for ["vdesign.cad/maturity（kotoba-lang/cadのscore/coverage-assessment/co-sientist-reviewの実配線）の設計決定" "real-approvalsが実在するgateのみをカウントする方針" "stageをRelease(7)まで進める判断基準は人間承認のみという方針"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "kotoba-lang-cad-cam-integration", :adr/related ["adr-2607083400-vdesign-cad-cam-bridge"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607083700-vdesign-cad-maturity-scoring", :adr/changes "[{:repo \"orgs/kotoba-lang/kami-engine-vehicle-designer\", :files [\"src/vdesign/cad.cljc\" \"src/vdesign/process.cljc\" \"src/vdesign/design.cljc\" \"test/vdesign/cad_bridge_test.clj\"], :summary \"envelope-dxf (real DXF export) + real-approvals (only genuinely-fired gates) + maturity (kotoba-lang/cad score/coverage-assessment/co-sientist-review) + :CadMaturity datom logging + audit entry surfacing\", :merge-commit \"094f78539e66d265bcfe76b08d0b5c6dd00cdcde\"}]", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-08", :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/date "2026-07-08", :adr/measured-results "{:before-approvals-wired {:approvals \"2/4\", :stage 5, :score-overall 74, :coverage-score 98, :mrl \"pilot-ready\"}, :after-real-graph-run-both-powertrains {:approvals \"4/4\", :stage 7, :score-overall 100, :coverage-score 100, :mrl \"production-candidate\", :blockers []}}", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "kami-engine-vehicle-designer に kotoba-lang/cad の実成熟度スコアリングを配線する — 承認は実在するgateのみカウントし、捏造しない", :adr/honesty-caveat "This score is process/governance completeness, not engineering capability. kotoba-lang/brep still only implements :extrude :operation :new (box-like prism); kotoba-lang/cnc still only really simulates :pocket/:drill. Reaching :mrl/production-candidate on this coarse heuristic does not mean a real vehicle became manufacturable -- it reflects that the pipeline's own self-declared gates (physics closure, sim verify, artifact classification, human sign-off) were genuinely passed and logged."}]